{"step_index":2009,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-27T07:39:53Z","input_tokens":2289,"cache_read_tokens":244530,"output_tokens":1968,"thinking":"CSS styling is required for several UI elements. Defining the styles for buttons, verified banners, icons with text, pre-requisite chips, example boxes, constraint lists, note headers and text areas. These elements require specific visual characteristics.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import os\n\ncss_path = r\"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\styles.css\"\ntmp_path = r\"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\styles.css.tmp\"\n\nphase3_css = \"\"\"\n/* =========================================================\n   PHASE 3: STRUCTURED 300-PROBLEM CATALOG, EXAMPLES & NOTES\n   ========================================================= */\n\n/* External LeetCode Source Link Button */\n.btn-external-link {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  color: #0284c7;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n\n.btn-external-link:hover {\n  background: #e0f2fe;\n  color: #0369a1;\n  border-color: #7dd3fc;\n}\n\n/* Reference Verification Banner */\n.modal-verification-strip {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: #f0fdf4;\n  border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;\n  border-left: 4px solid #10b981;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: #166534;\n}\n\n.verify-icon {\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #10b981;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n/* Prerequisites Chips */\n.prereqs-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.prereq-chip {\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\n  color: #1e40af;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 3px 10px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n}\n\n/* Structured Examples Box */\n.examples-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.example-box {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.example-num {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n.example-row code {\n  background: white;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n/* Constraints List */\n.constraints-list {\n  list-style-type: disc;\n  padding-left: 20px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.constraints-list code {\n  background: var(--bg-subtle);\n  padding: 1px 5px;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n}\n\n/* Personal Notes Section */\n.notes-header-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.notes-save-feedback {\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #10b981;\n}\n\n.modal-notes-textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 85px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  background: white;\n  resize: vertical;\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n}\n\n.modal-notes-textarea:focus {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);\n}\n\n.notes-action-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.btn-save-note {\n  background: #1e293b;\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 6px 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s;\n}\n\n.btn-save-note:hover {\n  background: #0f172a;\n}\n\n.notes-hint-text {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* Note Indicator on Table Row */\n.note-pill-indicator {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  cursor: default;\n}\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open(css_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    existing_css = f.read()\n\nnew_css = existing_css + \"\\n\" + phase3_css\n\nwith open(tmp_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(new_css)\n\nos.replace(tmp_path, css_path)\nprint(\"Successfully appended Phase 3 styles to styles.css!\")\n","Description":"Append Phase 3 styles to styles.css","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef\\scratch\\append_phase3_styles.py","toolAction":"Writing append_phase3_styles.py","toolSummary":"Create append_phase3_styles.py"}}]}
